{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54449","headline":"七言三首 二 · 林仙人","name":"七言三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清虚小有洞中天，银座金腰玉顶坚。\n芝草秀从龙汉劫，丹砂结自赤明年。\n洗参井纪燕萝子，聚虎平川白水仙。\n寄语避秦沟里客，茅斋先盖两三椽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林仙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}